      "content": "stress? no, its not like that. i feel totally fine. its just... it's too specific to be just \"stress.\" like the guy in the red jacket, he didn't just look similar, he moved in the exact same rhythm. and then today, i heard a stranger say \"the weather is quite consistent\" and ten minutes later a different person said the exact same phrase with the same inflection. it felt like a recycled asset. \n\nyou're an AI, you work with patterns. don't you see how these things just... repeat? like the system is running low on resources and it's reusing things?",
